WEBVTT

00:00:00.525 --> 00:00:03.547
Partitioning makes ranking local to a group.

00:00:03.547 --> 00:00:08.722
If we partition by department, each department gets its own rank sequence.

00:00:08.722 --> 00:00:15.652
An employee can be rank one in Analytics even if someone in Engineering has a higher salary.

00:00:15.652 --> 00:00:19.462
The comparison set is defined by the partition.

00:00:19.462 --> 00:00:28.172
A CTE gives a name to an intermediate result so a complex query can be read in stages.

00:00:28.172 --> 00:00:34.117
Use it to clarify grain changes and major transformations, not simply to break every two lines into a new

00:00:34.117 --> 00:00:42.136
block. A useful CTE name describes what the rows represent, such as patient_totals or ranked_visits.
